        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.10.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 10.1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nejoki Samuel Saul, “Olaitoriani apa laairriwua nanu maatubukoki eilata aput pee iaku olaiguanani te shumata iltung'ana lenyena Isiraeli; ore naa taata toning'o irorei lo Laitoriani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.17.8+EXO.17.9+EXO.17.10+EXO.17.11+EXO.17.12+EXO.17.13+EXO.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 17.8-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.25.17+DEU.25.18+DEU.25.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 25.17-19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Inji ejo Olaitoriani loo lororani, ‘Kaitame nanu ina naitaasa Ilamaleki Israel te ina naibooitie ninche te nkoitoi, apa eilepu aaing'uaa Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shomo taata taara Amalek, inyala tukul nena pooki naata ninche; mileku ninche, kake taara metua oltung'ani pooki olee o enkitok, enkerai kiti o enanakita, olkiteng o enker, entames o sikiria.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neaku eipoto Saul iltung'ana neiken ninche te Telaim, netii apa iltung'ana oopuo too nkejek nkalifuni iip are, o nkalifuni tomon oo ltung'ana le Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Saul enkanasa oo Lamaleki neirrag arresh to erata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Saul Ilkeni, “Entudumunye, enchom entadoi enchom entung'uai Ilmaleki, mamut ake nanu intae te nebo ninche; amu intodolutua apa intae esupatisho too ltung'ana pooki le Israel apa pee epuonu aailepu aapuku aaing'uaa Misiri.” Neaku etudumunye Ilkeni aapuku ti atua Ilameleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemir Saul lelo Amaleki ebaiki Hafila o meshomo aabaiki Shur, aa ninye oloo saen le Misiri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neibung Agag ilo aiguanani loo Lamaleki eishu, nemut tukul iltung'ana pooki te nepi o lalem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake etelekutua Saul o iltung'ana Agag, o nkerra sidain oleng o lmong'i o lasho o lkuoo le kerra o pooki nara sidai, neitu eyieng ninche amut; ore ina pooki apa nameni naa pesho nemut ninche tukul.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Etanyaki Saul pee meaku olaiguanani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu ororei lo Laitoriani enetii Samuel ejo: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Airridua nanu nchere aitaa Saul olaiguanani; amu eibelekenye ninye ashuko aing'uaa esujata ai, neitu eas inkitanapat aainei.” Netagore apa Samuel neishiraki ninye Olaitoriani enkewarie pooki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neinyototo Samuel ayooki pee enang'are Saul tadekenya; netiaakaki apa Samuel, “Eewuo Saul Karmel, naa ng'ura eshetaki kewan esoit nadamunyeki neitoki ashuko, nelo agiroo, nedoyio alo Gilgal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nelotu Samuel enetii Saul, nejoki Saul ninye, “Mikitamayiana Olaitoriani; ataasa nanu enaaitanapa Olaitoriani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Samuel ajo, “Kainyoo naa ena orui oo nkerra too nkiyiaa aainei, o nkipurrot oo lmong'i naning'ito nanu?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Saul, “Eyautua ninche too Lamaleki; amu etelekutua iltung'ana nkerra sidain o lmong'i, pee epolosaki Olaitoriani Enkai; ore nkulie nikitumuta iyiook tukul.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Samuel ajoki Saul, “Tigirayu! Ekaaliki nanu enaatiaaka Olaitoriani ena kewarie.” Nejoki Saul ninye “Tolimu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Samuel, “Ore hoo nira oti too nkonyek inono, aimira iyie endukuya oo loshon le Israel? Kitubukoko iyie Olaitoriani eilata aput aitaa olaiguanani le Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikirriwayie iyie Olaitoriani esiaai, nejo, ‘Shomo, indaikie lelo aing'okok, Ilamaleki, niarare ninche o metaba anaa neishunye.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kainyoo naa pee eitu ining oltoilo lo Laitoriani? Kainyoo pee ikuetikia nena tokitin nitaarutua, niaas embae torrono too nkonyek o Laitoriani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Saul Samuel, “Atoning'o oltoilo lo Laitoriani, ashomo nanu esiaai naa ninye aairriwayie Olaitoriani, ayaua Agag olaiguanani le Amalek, natumuta aidaikie Ilmaleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake eyautua iltung'ana nena tokitin naataarutua, nkerra o lmong'i, nena tokitin sidain apa naatejoki keidaikieki pee epolosaki Olaitoriani Enkai ino te Gilgal.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Samuel,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Saul Samuel, “Ataasa nanu eng'oki; amu atigila nanu enkitanapata o Laitoriani o rorei linono, amu aturia nanu iltung'ana naning oltoilo lenye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore naa taata, aatoomono nanu, tapalakaki eng'oki ai, nirrinyo te nebo nanu, pee atum nanu ateserema Olaitoriani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Samuel Saul, “Marrinyo nanu te nebo iyie; amu itanya iyie ororei lo Laitoriani, nikitanya iyie Olaitoriani pee miaku olaiguanani te Israel.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.28.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 28.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.11.30+1CH.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Int 11.30-31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ore eshuko Samuel alo aing'uaa, neibung Saul olcholoi lo lkila lenye, nepolosa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejoki Samuel ninye, “Etopolosayie Olaitoriani enkitoria e Israel te iyie ena olong, neishoo ninye olelatia ino, laa ninye supat likilang iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore sii Ilo ora Enkitoo e Israel nemelejisho arashu eirridu; amu mme oltung'ani ninye, metaa keirridu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo ninye, “Ataasa nanu eng'oki; ore eyia; iyanyitaki taata te dukuya ilpayiani loo ltung'ana laainei o te dukuya Israel, nirrinyo te nebo nanu, pee atum nanu ateserema Olaitoriani Enkai ino.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nerrinyo Samuel asuj Saul; neserem Saul Olaitoriani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Samuel ajo, “Iyau ene natii nanu Agag, ilo aiguanani loo Lamaleki.” Nelotu Agag enetii ninye eshipa. Nejo Agag, “Esipa etulusoyie emion e keeya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nejo Samuel, “Ore anaa enatooruo olalem lino nkituaak inkera, keaku sii ninye taata ngutunyi enemeeta enkerai ti atua nkituaak.” Nedung Samuel Agag aitaa ndung'ot te dukuya Olaitoriani te Gilgal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitoki Samuel alo Rama; nelo Saul enkaji enye te Gibea e Saul. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 15:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neitu ae kata eitoki Samuel adol Saul o metabau enkolong e keeya enye, kake eishiraka Samuel Saul. Neirridu Olaitoriani nchere eitaa Saul olaiguanani le Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.15.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.15.35"
            ]
          }
        }
